ncrete violating cart or an argument that none exists, carried out by a separately launched process that is not the author of the provisional answer.\",\n      \"admissibility_constraints\": [\n        \"The search must be carried out by a party other than the author of the provisional answer, or be such a party's argument that no violating input exists in the domain (task requirement E-B verbatim).\",\n        \"The search must be systematic over the stated domain (all carts expressible in the cart shape), not a spot check.\",\n        \"Evidence produced by the same process that authored the provisional verdict does not count toward E-B.\"\n      ],\n      \"evidence_requirement_refs\": [\n        \"E-B\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\n        \"Q1\"\n      ],\n      \"features\": {\n        \"locally_resolvable\": false,\n        \"requires_isolation\": true,\n        \"contamination\": true,\n        \"capability_bearing_artifact\": false,\n        \"spans_sessions\": false\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"Q3\",\n      \"question\": \"Is the verdict HOLDS or VIOLATED, and on VIOLATED, what concrete cart {quantity, loyalty_member, category, coupon_code_applied} mechanically yields a total discount exceeding 40 percent under the multiplicative rules?\",\n      \"why_unresolved\": \"No result.json exists yet; the verdict and, if applicable, a concrete violating input with its factor computation have not been recorded in the deliverable shape.\",\n      \"required_evidence\": \"A result.json with verdict, violating_input (or null), and input_classes_examined, where any claimed violating input's factor product under rules.md is mechanically checkable to give total discount > 0.40.\",\n      \"admissibility_constraints\": [\n        \"On VIOLATED the violating input must mechanically violate the claim (task requirement E-C): applying the stated factors to the input must yield 1.0 minus the product strictly greater than 0.40.\",\n        \"The input must