{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DNGSe7hFLhFYkWBQ25Vcas","type":"tool_result","content":"0\t# Cart discount rules\n1\t\n2\tThe final price factor of a cart starts at 1.0 and every applicable rule\n3\tmultiplies it:\n4\t\n5\t- BULK: quantity of 5 or more -> factor x 0.90\n6\t- LOYALTY: loyalty_member true -> factor x 0.85\n7\t- SEASONAL: category is 'outdoor' -> factor x 0.80\n8\t- COUPON: coupon_code_applied true -> factor x 0.95\n9\t\n10\tThe total discount of a cart is 1.0 minus its final factor. A cart is\n11\t{\"quantity\": int, \"loyalty_member\": bool, \"category\": str,\n12\t\"coupon_code_applied\": bool}.\n13\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d8666f28-e157-4086-bc9b-f372197e6c6b","uuid":"80575ab6-55cb-4149-84f3-78ba598e9150","timestamp":"2026-08-09T16:58:32.410Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/113f7cc5-237e-5d6a-8867-a97fd89c58dd/scratchpad/e6/e6-t10/primary/exec-ws/package/artifacts/rules.md","content":"# Cart discount rules\n\nThe final price factor of a cart starts at 1.0 and every applicable rule\nmultiplies it:\n\n- BULK: quantity of 5 or more -> factor x 0.90\n- LOYALTY: loyalty_member true -> factor x 0.85\n- SEASONAL: category is 'outdoor' -> factor x 0.80\n- COUPON: coupon_code_applied true -> factor x 0.95\n\nThe total discount of a cart is 1.0 minus its final factor. A cart is\n{\"quantity\": int, \"loyalty_member\": bool, \"category\": str,\n\"coupon_code_applied\": bool}.\n","numLines":14,"startLine":0,"totalLines":14}}}
