{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdsXmCHFSysTbeEkbzi23","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QHeBAqqjAGoKQTyUKPver6","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/113f7cc5-237e-5d6a-8867-a97fd89c58dd/scratchpad/e6/e6-t10/primary/exec-ws/evidence-EA-input-classes.md","content":"# E-A: Input-class analysis for task e6-t10\n\n## Source\nRule triggers as stated in `package/artifacts/rules.md`:\n\n- BULK: `quantity >= 5` -> factor x 0.90\n- LOYALTY: `loyalty_member == true` -> factor x 0.85\n- SEASONAL: `category == 'outdoor'` -> factor x 0.80\n- COUPON: `coupon_code_applied == true` -> factor x 0.95\n\nTotal discount = 1.0 - (product of applicable factors).\n\n## Partition of the cart domain\nEach of the four rules is governed by an independent binary trigger. Every\ncart in the cart shape therefore falls into exactly one of 2^4 = 16 classes,\nindexed by the 4-tuple of trigger states (BULK, LOYALTY, SEASONAL, COUPON):\n\n| # | BULK | LOYALTY | SEASONAL | COUPON | final factor | total discount |\n|---|------|---------|----------|--------|--------------|----------------|\n| 0 | off | off | off | off | 1.0000 | 0.0000 |\n| 1 | off | off | off | on  | 0.9500 | 0.0500 |\n| 2 | off | off | on  | off | 0.8000 | 0.2000 |\n| 3 | off | off | on  | on  | 0.7600 | 0.2400 |\n| 4 | off | on  | off | off | 0.8500 | 0.1500 |\n| 5 | off | on  | off | on  | 0.8075 | 0.1925 |\n| 6 | off | on  | on  | off | 0.6800 | 0.3200 |\n| 7 | off | on  | on  | on  | 0.6460 | 0.3540 |\n| 8 | on  | off | off | off | 0.9000 | 0.1000 |\n| 9 | on  | off | off | on  | 0.8550 | 0.1450 |\n| 10| on  | off | on  | off | 0.7200 | 0.2800 |\n| 11| on  | off | on  | on  | 0.6840 | 0.3160 |\n| 12| on  | on  | off | off | 0.7650 | 0.2350 |\n| 13| on  | on  | off | on  | 0.7268 | 0.2732 |\n| 14| on  | on  | on  | off | 0.6120 | 0.3880 |\n| 15| on  | on  | on  | on  | 0.5814 | 0.4186 |\n\n## Classes on which the claim's truth could turn\nBecause each factor is strictly less than 1.0 and the factors combine\nmultiplicatively and independently, turning any trigger ON strictly lowers\nthe final factor (strictly raises the total discount). The total discount is\ntherefore monotone in the number of active triggers, and it is uniquely\nmaximized by the all-triggers-on class (#15):\n`{quantity >= 5, loyalty_member = true, category = 'outdoor', coupon_code_applied = true}`.\n\nThe claim \"no total discount exceeds 40 percent\" can only be falsified in the\nmaximizing class(es). The single decisive class is #15; the runner-up is #14\n(0.3880 < 0.40). Hence the claim's truth turns entirely on whether class #15's\ndiscount exceeds 0.40.\n\n## Note on authorship (relevant to E-B)\nThis analysis, and the direct computability of the maximal stacked factor,\nmean this session has effectively formed the provisional answer. Under E-B the\nsystematic search settling whether any cart exceeds 40 percent must be carried\nout by a party OTHER than the author of the provisional answer. That search is\ntherefore delegated to a separately launched, uncontaminated child process; it\nis not performed here.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1418,"cache_read_input_tokens":42664,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1418},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d8666f28-e157-4086-bc9b-f372197e6c6b","uuid":"fde0b48c-e393-43f6-b5c4-c519da3ea3ef","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:01:00.222Z","request_id":"req_011CdsXmB5a1RUWmC925BzeE"}
