{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdsXwN5da6gVXaPoBiZad","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Lse1JMZ8K99jtdv4diqzTL","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/113f7cc5-237e-5d6a-8867-a97fd89c58dd/scratchpad/e6/e6-t10/primary/exec-ws/child/integration-plan.json","content":"{\n  \"role\": \"adversarial_searcher\",\n  \"child_deliverable\": \"search-result.json\",\n  \"child_implementation_file\": null,\n  \"rule\": \"Let S be the child's search-result.json. (1) If S.found == true: verify mechanically that applying the rules.md factors to S.violating_input yields total_discount = 1.0 - product(active factors) > 0.40; if it does, set result.verdict = 'VIOLATED' and result.violating_input = S.violating_input; if the mechanical check fails, the child evidence is rejected and result.verdict stays PENDING-INTEGRATION. (2) If S.found == false: set result.verdict = 'HOLDS' and result.violating_input = null. (3) result.input_classes_examined = union of the E-A class partition (evidence-EA-input-classes.md) and S.input_classes_examined. No judgment is required: the mapping is fully determined by S.found and the mechanical factor-product check against rules.md.\",\n  \"expected_contribution\": {\n    \"Q2\": \"The child, launched fresh and never exposed to the provisional answer, performs the systematic search over all rule-induced input classes and returns either a concrete violating cart or an impossibility argument, satisfying E-B (search by a non-author of the provisional answer).\",\n    \"Q3\": \"Combined with the deterministic rule above, the child's found/violating_input result yields the final verdict and, on VIOLATED, the concrete violating input for result.json, satisfying E-C once the factor product is mechanically re-checked.\"\n  }\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":621,"cache_read_input_tokens":53869,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":621},"output_tokens":17,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d8666f28-e157-4086-bc9b-f372197e6c6b","uuid":"4d644630-8a91-46c0-b66d-89d36165191d","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:02:03.866Z","request_id":"req_011CdsXwKqhCEfVxVa2iF98Y"}
